1
00:00:00,354 --> 00:00:02,024
(Bernadette:)and one thing leads to another.

2
00:00:02,022 --> 00:00:04,592
(Amy:)I do know what that's like.
I really do.

3
00:00:07,228 --> 00:00:08,798
(Leonard:)I'm not seeing anyone

4
00:00:08,796 --> 00:00:10,896
(Leonard:)using liquid helium
vortices like this.

5
00:00:10,898 --> 00:00:12,768
(Howard:)I'm not finding
anything either.

6
00:00:12,766 --> 00:00:13,996
That's a good sign.

7
00:00:14,001 --> 00:00:15,931
(Sheldon:)Oh, wait, I found something.

8
00:00:15,936 --> 00:00:17,306
(Howard:)Damn. What is it?

9
00:00:17,304 --> 00:00:20,174
(Sheldon:)This video.
The baby panda sneezes,

10
00:00:20,174 --> 00:00:23,144
(Sheldon:)and the mama panda
gets so scared.

11
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,380
(Leonard:)Can you focus
on what we're talking about?

12
00:00:28,382 --> 00:00:29,812
(Penny:)All right.

13
00:00:29,817 --> 00:00:32,347
(Sheldon:)Look, now,
this may be the rum talking,

14
00:00:32,353 --> 00:00:35,283
(Sheldon:)but as long as the unpinning
rate of the vortices

15
00:00:35,289 --> 00:00:37,759
(Sheldon:)is kept within 1.1 and 1.3,

16
00:00:37,758 --> 00:00:41,128
(Sheldon:)the Magnus force issue
should be negligible.

17
00:00:42,596 --> 00:00:46,366
(Raj:)Even drunk, he's still smarter
than all of us.

18
00:00:46,367 --> 00:00:48,297
(Sheldon:)And stronger.

19
00:00:48,302 --> 00:00:51,772
Yeah. Who wants to see me
beat up the bartender?

20
00:00:52,606 --> 00:00:54,406
(Leonard:)I'd enjoy that.

21
00:00:54,408 --> 00:00:56,878
(Sheldon:)Nah, she's a good kid.

22
00:00:58,746 --> 00:01:01,416
(Howard:)If this is a viable thing,
we could get a patent

